ting no place but wait."}, {"start": "01:46:52", "end": "01:47:15", "text": "I've been silent, breathing, spent a couple G's from the SS season, sold another deal and made it back, easy. I still got fans out in Paris trying to meet me, had this French guy talking to me in Swahili, said he got that river now, bumping out. Wanted an autograph, so I put it on the CD, you never get used to that feeling. I took a break after the drop to let you catch up, but still."}, {"start": "01:48:35", "end": "01:48:55", "text": "When it's the vision of a dream, a winning is constant. Encoded in me, my purpose was never a concept. Nylogy embodies the spirit of a prophet. So know when I stand with the ministers and the MPs, I still know the guys that roll in 16th deep. They call that code, switching the sidelines and flip the keys. Silence isn't a weakness, when God is the machine."}, {"start": "02:48:03", "end": "02:48:23", "text": "We'll see you next time."}, {"start": "03:21:07", "end": "03:21:45", "text": "Five o'clock in the morning is, yeah, maybe four sometimes. Yeah, you see sunlight doesn't expand like we've always been drawing the sun coming up the mountains. Now, it shoots up, straight up to us, that's Kanoor. During the Nigerian ceremony, when the men sings, women dance, flicking their finger like that. So they get to expand the light going this way, horizontally."}, {"start": "03:22:14", "end": "03:23:02", "text": "First, he had to grow like a tree, straight up. That means, yeah, everything is born unto you. Everything around you, yeah, gonna be you. Embrace them while you can. Learn about them. Because they'll guide you how you should live. Because you're gonna have to adapt to this harsh country. and enjoy its richness, I guess, with that knowledge. Because if you don't, your birch ride is stripped from you and your life falls short. It's a really hard country out here."}, {"start": "03:24:42", "end": "03:25:28", "text": "But learning through these knowledges through the initiation ceremony of this place here, that's what I mean by negative and positive consequences of the law. It makes or breaks you. Haka and Albert, it's just the way the country is built. Or created, that's all."}], "fbi_json": [{"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:21:37"}, "track": {"title": "A thousand lies", "artists": [{"name": "Smerz"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:29:56"}, "track": {"title": "Electrolytes (feat. Lonelyspeck)", "artists": [{"name": "Headaches"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:43:00"}, "track": {"title": "Your Love", "artists": [{"name": "Frankie Knuckles"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:48:14"}, "track": {"title": "You Can't Always Get What You Want", "artists": [{"name": "Erika de Casier"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:57:03"}, "track": {"title": "Shot Caller (Shuga's Edit)", "artists": [{"name": "Nina Las Vegas"}, {"name": "Swick & Zanillya"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "01:05:00"}, "track": {"title": "Shekinah Glory", "artists": [{"name": "Kyle Lovett"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "01:12:31"}, "track": {"title": "Off to the Esso", "artists": [{"name": "aya"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "01:30:34"}, "track": {"title": "Move On", "artists": [{"name": "Olivia Escuyos"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "01:46:47"}, "track": {"title": "SIZE FOUR", "artists": [{"name": "Elsy Wameyo"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "high"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "01:52:51"}, "track": {"title": "B.S.A.S. (Si Alguna Ve